"Deletes an entry added with `compendium add` (or written into\n"
"`systems/<pack>/homebrew/compendium/` by hand); `didact undo` brings it back.\n"
"Records spawned from it stay. A pack's own entries can't be deleted, but a house\n"
"rule can change them: `didact override add entry <entry> --data '{…}'`."
msgstr ""
"Sletter en post tilføjet med `compendium add` (eller skrevet i\n"
"`systems/<pack>/homebrew/compendium/` i hånden); `didact undo` bringer den tilbage.\n"
"Opslag skabt ud fra den bliver. En pakkes egne poster kan ikke slettes, men en husregel\n"
"kan ændre dem: `didact override add entry <entry> --data '{…}'`."

