"Follows the inventories: a sword in a chest in a house shows as `in Chest › at My\n"
"House`. Put things somewhere with `didact inv move <who> <item> <record>`: a place\n"
"or a container record holds items like a character does. The player view leaves out\n"
"secret holders; --gm also shows a record's own `where` detail."
msgstr ""
"Følger inventarerne: et sværd i en kiste i et hus vises som `in Chest › at My\n"
"House`. Placér ting et sted med `didact inv move <who> <item> <record>`: et sted\n"
"eller et beholderopslag rummer genstande, ligesom en person gør. Spillervisningen udelader\n"
"hemmelige holdere; --gm viser også et opslags egen `where`-detalje."

